<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>ZIP Strategy Finder</title><style>:root{font-family:Inter,system-ui,Arial;background:#f3f6fa;color:#17243a}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}.wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:auto;padding:32px 20px}header{background:#102743;color:white;padding:30px 0}header h1{margin:0;font-size:30px}header p{opacity:.8}section,.card{background:white;border:1px solid #e0e6ef;border-radius:14px;padding:22px;margin-top:18px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px #17243a0a}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr));gap:14px}.metric{background:#f6f9fc;padding:16px;border-radius:10px}.metric strong{font-size:22px;display:block;margin-top:6px}.muted{color:#63718a;font-size:13px}label{font-weight:650;font-size:13px;display:block;margin-bottom:6px}input{width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid #b8c6d8;border-radius:8px;font-size:16px}button{background:#1764bd;color:white;border:0;padding:13px 20px;border-radius:9px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:wait}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:end}.bar{height:12px;background:#e8edf4;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}.fill{height:100%;background:#1764bd}.score{display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1fr 60px;gap:14px;align-items:center;margin:15px 0}.pill{display:inline-block;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:30px;background:#e3f2e9;color:#14623b;font-weight:700}.error{color:#a22a29;background:#fff0ef;padding:12px;border-radius:8px}.note{background:#fff8e8;padding:13px;border-left:4px solid #d49a26;margin-top:14px}a{color:#1764bd}details{margin-top:12px}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}@media(max-width:650px){.fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}.score{grid-template-columns:95px 1fr 44px}header h1{font-size:24px}}</style></head><body><header><div class="wrap"><h1>ZIP Strategy Finder</h1><p>Cash Flow · Hybrid · Appreciation | U.S. housing market screening</p></div></header><main class="wrap"><section><h2>Analyze a ZIP code</h2><p>Retrieves U.S. Census ACS housing and demographic estimates for the corresponding ZIP Code Tabulation Area (ZCTA). No invented property listings or forecasts. This browser-only edition can be hosted on a static website. Updated Census request format and clearer diagnostics.</p><div class="fields"><div><label for="zip">ZIP code</label><input id="zip" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="5" value="06416" placeholder="5-digit ZIP"></div><div><label for="key">Census API key</label><input id="key" placeholder="Paste free Census API key" type="password"></div><button id="go">Analyze ZIP</button></div><p class="muted">Request a free API key at <a href="https://api.census.gov/data/key_signup.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Census API Key Signup</a>. The key is sent directly to api.census.gov. If you see HTTP 400, read the detailed Census error shown below. Avoid publishing your API key in public source code. If automatic data access is blocked, use the property calculator below.</p><div id="status" aria-live="polite"></div></section><section><h2>Manual property analysis — works without Census access</h2><p>Enter a home's price and expected monthly rent to estimate rental cash flow. This calculator works offline; it does not pretend to know ZIP-specific appreciation.</p><div class="grid" id="manualFields"><div><label>Purchase price ($)</label><input id="mprice" type="number" value="300000"></div><div><label>Monthly rent ($)</label><input id="mrent" type="number" value="2200"></div><div><label>Down payment (%)</label><input id="mdown" type="number" value="25"></div><div><label>Mortgage rate (%)</label><input id="mrate" type="number" value="7"></div><div><label>Annual property taxes ($)</label><input id="mtax" type="number" value="5000"></div><div><label>Annual insurance ($)</label><input id="mins" type="number" value="1800"></div></div><button style="margin-top:14px" onclick="manualCalc()">Calculate</button><div id="manualResult"></div></section><div id="results" hidden><section><div id="heading"></div><div class="grid" id="metrics"></div><div class="note">ACS home value is the median value of <b>owner-occupied</b> housing; ACS contract rent is the median for <b>renter-occupied</b> units. These are not matched properties, asking rents, or current sale prices. The resulting gross yield is a rough area-level proxy, not an achievable property return.</div></section><section><h2>Investment strategy comparison</h2><div id="scores"></div><p id="recommendation"></p><p class="muted">Heuristic 0–100 scores based on available indicators, not calibrated return forecasts or national percentile rankings. See methodology below.</p></section><section><h2>Individual property calculator</h2><p>Enter the actual purchase price and expected rent for a property in this ZIP to estimate cash flow. Default assumptions are editable and are <b>not</b> retrieved property facts.</p><div class="grid" id="propertyFields"></div><button id="calculate" style="margin-top:14px">Calculate property cash flow</button><div id="propertyOutput" style="margin-top:14px"></div><p><a id="listingLink" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Search homes for sale on Zillow (external)</a> · <a id="rentalLink" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Search rentals on Zillow (external)</a></p><p class="muted">This application cannot fetch or rank individual active listings without a licensed listings feed. The external links open separate searches.</p></section><section><details><summary>Scoring methodology and limitations</summary><p>Each indicator is converted to a bounded 0–100 heuristic score. Yield score: 0% = 0, 10% = 100. Five-year annualized change in median owner-occupied home value: −3% = 0, +8% = 100. Annualized median contract rent growth: −2% = 0, +7% = 100. Annualized population change: −2% = 0, +3% = 100. Employment-to-population rate: 35% = 0, 75% = 100. Unemployment: 15% = 0, 2% = 100. Price-to-income affordability: ratio 12 = 0, ratio 2 = 100. Missing indicators receive a neutral 50 and are identified as missing.</p><p>Cash Flow = 60% yield + 15% rent growth + 15% affordability + 10% employment. Hybrid = 30% yield + 25% home value change + 15% rent growth + 15% population growth + 15% employment. Appreciation = 15% yield + 60% appreciation potential + 25% fundamentals, where appreciation potential = 65% historical home value change + 20% population growth + 15% affordability, and fundamentals = 45% employment + 35% population growth + 20% unemployment. Historical changes in ACS medians reflect changes in housing composition and sampling as well as prices; they are <b>not</b> repeat-sales appreciation measures. The 2019 and 2024 five-year ACS windows do not overlap, but ZCTA boundaries and samples may differ. These scores are exploratory, not investment advice.</p></details></section></div><section><h2>Data sources</h2><p><a href="https://www.census.gov/data/developers/data-sets/acs-5year.2024.html" target="_blank">2024 ACS 5-year</a> and <a href="https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/acs/data/data-via-api.html" target="_blank">Census Data API</a>. Historical comparison: 2019 ACS 5-year. Data are released with a lag, so results are not live market prices.</p></section></main><script>
function manualCalc(){const v=id=>Number(document.getElementById(id).value),p=v('mprice'),rent=v('mrent'),down=v('mdown')/100,rate=v('mrate')/1200;if(!(p>0&&rent>=0&&down>=0&&down<=1&&rate>=0)){document.getElementById('manualResult').textContent='Please enter valid values.';return;}const loan=p*(1-down),payment=loan*(rate===0?1/360:rate/(1-Math.pow(1+rate,-360))),expenses=v('mtax')/12+v('mins')/12+p*.01/12+rent*.05+rent*.08,flow=rent-expenses-payment,yieldPct=rent*12/p*100;document.getElementById('manualResult').innerHTML=`<div class="grid" style="margin-top:16px"><div class="metric">Gross rental yield<strong>${yieldPct.toFixed(2)}%</strong></div><div class="metric">Estimated monthly cash flow<strong>$${flow.toFixed(0)}</strong></div><div class="metric">Monthly mortgage P&I<strong>$${payment.toFixed(0)}</strong></div></div><p class="muted">Assumes 30-year loan, 5% vacancy, 8% management, 1% annual maintenance. Excludes closing costs, HOA and major capital expenditures. Appreciation and hybrid suitability require market trend data.</p>`;}
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id),fmt=(x,d=0)=>Number.isFinite(x)?x.toLocaleString('en-US',{maximumFractionDigits:d,minimumFractionDigits:d}):'Unavailable',usd=x=>Number.isFinite(x)?x.toLocaleString('en-US',{style:'currency',currency:'USD',maximumFractionDigits:0}):'Unavailable',clamp=x=>Math.max(0,Math.min(100,x)),scale=(v,lo,hi,reverse=false)=>Number.isFinite(v)?clamp(100*(reverse?hi-v:v-lo)/(hi-lo)):50;let data=null;
const vars=['NAME','B25077_001E','B25058_001E','B19013_001E','B01003_001E','B23025_003E','B23025_004E','B23025_005E','B23025_002E'];
async function census(year,zip,key){
  const u=new URL(`https://api.census.gov/data/${year}/acs/acs5`);
  u.searchParams.set('get',vars.join(','));
  u.searchParams.set('for',`zip code tabulation area:${zip}`);
  
  if(key)u.searchParams.set('key',key);
  let r;
  try{r=await fetch(u,{cache:'no-store'});}catch(e){throw new Error('The browser could not reach the Census API. Check your connection, try hosting this page on GitHub Pages, or use the manual calculator below. Browser cross-origin restrictions may apply.');}
  const body=await r.text();let j;try{j=JSON.parse(body)}catch{j=null}
  if(!r.ok)throw new Error(`Census ${year} returned HTTP ${r.status}: ${body.slice(0,350)}${r.status===400?' — Check ZIP, Census variable availability, and API key.':''}`);
  if(!Array.isArray(j)||j.length<2)throw new Error(`No ACS ${year} data found for ZIP ${zip}.`);
  return Object.fromEntries(j[0].map((k,i)=>[k,j[1][i]]));
}
function num(obj,k){const n=Number(obj?.[k]);return Number.isFinite(n)&&n>=0&&n!==-666666666&&n!==-999999999?n:NaN}
function cagr(now,old){return now>0&&old>0?(Math.pow(now/old,1/5)-1)*100:NaN}
function field(name,value){return `<div class="metric"><span class="muted">${name}</span><strong>${value}</strong></div>`}
function render(){const d=data, p=d.p,old=d.old;const value=num(p,'B25077_001E'),rent=num(p,'B25058_001E'),income=num(p,'B19013_001E'),pop=num(p,'B01003_001E'),labor=num(p,'B23025_002E'),employed=num(p,'B23025_004E'),unemployed=num(p,'B23025_003E')-employed; // corrected below via civilian labor and employed
const civilian=num(p,'B23025_003E'),emp=num(p,'B23025_004E');const unemp= civilian>0?num(p,'B23025_005E')/civilian*100:NaN;const employment=pop>0?emp/pop*100:NaN;
const yieldPct=value>0?12*rent/value*100:NaN,houseGrowth=cagr(value,num(old,'B25077_001E')),rentGrowth=cagr(rent,num(old,'B25058_001E')),popGrowth=cagr(pop,num(old,'B01003_001E')),afford=value>0&&income>0?value/income:NaN;
const s={yield:scale(yieldPct,0,10),rent:scale(rentGrowth,-2,7),home:scale(houseGrowth,-3,8),population:scale(popGrowth,-2,3),employment:scale(employment,35,75),unemployment:scale(unemp,2,15,true),affordability:scale(afford,2,12,true)};
const cash=.60*s.yield+.15*s.rent+.15*s.affordability+.10*s.employment,hybrid=.30*s.yield+.25*s.home+.15*s.rent+.15*s.population+.15*s.employment,appPotential=.65*s.home+.20*s.population+.15*s.affordability,fundamentals=.45*s.employment+.35*s.population+.20*s.unemployment,app=.15*s.yield+.60*appPotential+.25*fundamentals;
$('heading').innerHTML=`<h2>${d.zip} · ${p.NAME||'ZIP Code Tabulation Area'}</h2><p class="muted">2024 ACS 5-year estimates; historical comparison 2019 ACS 5-year</p>`;
$('metrics').innerHTML=[field('Median owner-occupied home value',usd(value)),field('Median monthly contract rent',usd(rent)),field('Gross yield proxy',fmt(yieldPct,2)+'%'),field('5-year annualized median value change',fmt(houseGrowth,2)+'%'),field('5-year annualized median rent change',fmt(rentGrowth,2)+'%'),field('Population',fmt(pop)),field('Population annualized change',fmt(popGrowth,2)+'%'),field('Median household income',usd(income)),field('Unemployment proxy',fmt(unemp,1)+'%')].join('');
const scores=[['Cash Flow',cash],['Hybrid',hybrid],['Appreciation',app]].sort((a,b)=>b[1]-a[1]);$('scores').innerHTML=scores.map(([name,v])=>`<div class="score"><b>${name}</b><div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width:${v.toFixed(1)}%"></div></div><b>${v.toFixed(1)}</b></div>`).join('');$('recommendation').innerHTML=`<span class="pill">Highest relative score: ${scores[0][0]}</span> &nbsp; This is a screening classification, not proof that any house will be profitable.`;
const fields=[['price','Purchase price ($)',Number.isFinite(value)?Math.round(value):300000],['monthlyRent','Expected monthly rent ($)',Number.isFinite(rent)?Math.round(rent):1800],['down','Down payment (%)',25],['rate','Mortgage interest (%)',7],['tax','Annual property tax (%)',1.5],['insurance','Annual insurance ($)',1800],['maintenance','Maintenance (% of value / yr)',1],['vacancy','Vacancy (%)',5],['management','Management (% of rent)',8]];
$('propertyFields').innerHTML=fields.map(([id,label,v])=>`<div><label for="${id}">${label}</label><input id="${id}" type="number" min="0" step="any" value="${v}"></div>`).join('');$('listingLink').href=`https://www.zillow.com/homes/${d.zip}_rb/`;$('rentalLink').href=`https://www.zillow.com/homes/for_rent/${d.zip}_rb/`;$('results').hidden=false;calculate();}
function calculate(){const g=id=>Number($(id).value),price=g('price'),rent=g('monthlyRent'),loan=price*(1-g('down')/100),r=g('rate')/1200,monthlyMortgage=loan*(r===0?1/360:r/(1-Math.pow(1+r,-360))),income=rent*(1-g('vacancy')/100),cost=price*g('tax')/1200/100+g('insurance')/12+price*g('maintenance')/1200/100+rent*g('management')/100,noi=income-cost,flow=noi-monthlyMortgage,cashInvested=price*g('down')/100; if(!Number.isFinite(flow)||price<=0||rent<0||g('down')>100){$('propertyOutput').innerHTML='<p class="error">Please enter valid nonnegative inputs (down payment at most 100%).</p>';return} $('propertyOutput').innerHTML=`<div class="grid">${field('Estimated monthly cash flow',usd(flow))}${field('Annual cap rate (NOI / price)',fmt(noi*12/price*100,2)+'%')}${field('Cash-on-cash (excluding closing costs)',cashInvested>0?fmt(flow*12/cashInvested*100,2)+'%':'N/A')}${field('Monthly mortgage principal & interest',usd(monthlyMortgage))}</div><p class="muted">Illustrative 30-year fixed mortgage. Excludes closing costs, utilities, HOA, capital expenditures beyond maintenance allowance, tax effects, and selling costs.</p>`}
$('calculate').onclick=calculate;
$('go').onclick=async()=>{const zip=$('zip').value.trim(),key=$('key').value.trim();if(!/^\d{5}$/.test(zip)){ $('status').innerHTML='<p class="error">Enter a valid five-digit ZIP code.</p>';return}$('go').disabled=true;$('status').textContent='Retrieving 2024 and 2019 Census data directly…';$('results').hidden=true;try{const [p,old]=await Promise.all([census(2024,zip,key),census(2019,zip,key)]);data={p,old,zip};render();$('status').textContent='Data loaded successfully.'}catch(e){$('status').innerHTML=`<p class="error">${String(e.message).replaceAll('<','&lt;')}</p>`}finally{$('go').disabled=false}};
</script></body></html>
